# Production deploy — always push main

**Live:** marketmeerkat.guru · **Branch:** `main` · **Host:** Vercel Production (auto-deploy on push)

## Default completion for shipping tasks

After verified changes (commit requested, fix, feature, or "push main"):

1. `npm run verify` — must pass before push
2. Commit on `main`
3. **`git push origin main`** — required unless user explicitly says not to
4. Confirm: `git status` → "up to date with origin/main"

Never end a shipping task with commits only on the local machine.

## Exceptions

Skip push only when the user explicitly says: hold, local only, don't push, or draft/WIP.
